# Local documentation/reference workspace.
# INDEX.md remains the single repository navigation entry point. Existing
# tracked Markdown files remain tracked until deliberately removed from Git;
# this only prevents new Markdown/reference docs from being added by accident.
*.md
!INDEX.md
!RULES.md
!TODO.md
